    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eNIZA Ceiling or Wall Light for GU10 Bulb\u003c/strong\u003e combines modern design and professional performance. Made of high-quality aluminum with honeycomb panel optics, offers \u003cstrong\u003eUGR\u0026lt;13\u003c/strong\u003e. Adjustable design.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eWall or Ceiling Light for GU10 Lamps | NIZA UGR13 | Anti-Glare\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe NIZA wall or ceiling light for GU10 bulbs is a versatile and sophisticated lighting solution, designed to bring style, functionality, and maximum visual comfort to any space. Its minimalist and contemporary design makes it a decorative piece that enhances its surroundings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eMade of high-quality aluminum, it features \u003cstrong\u003ehoneycomb optics\u003c/strong\u003e that reduce glare and provide a \u003cstrong\u003eUGR\u003c13\u003c/strong\u003e, offering a more comfortable and eye-friendly light. Its adjustable head allows you to direct the light beam with total precision, adapting to different needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eUses and Applications:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAt Home:\u003c/strong\u003e Bedrooms (reading light), living rooms (accent lighting), and hallways.\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCommercial Spaces:\u003c/strong\u003e Shops, hotels, restaurants, and offices.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e*GU10 bulb not included.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
